# ─── SAFETY: this Git repo is rooted at your HOME directory ───
# Deny everything by default so a stray `git add` can NEVER stage secrets
# (~/.ssh, ~/.aws, ~/.config, ~/.netrc, Library/, .Trash/, etc.) and push
# them to the remote. Only the project workspace below is trackable.
# Fully reversible — to track something elsewhere, add another `!` rule.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Documents/
/Documents/*
!/Documents/Claude code/
# the-desk now lives in its own private repo (createwithsequence-byte/pendulumpro)
/Documents/Claude code/the-desk/

# ─── Within the workspace, still ignore build output + local secrets ───
.vercel
.env*.local
